&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technology Advisory Analyst serves on AI-native advisory teams, empowering clients to navigate the critical junction of strategy and technical execution. Collaborating with senior leadership and technical specialists, you will anchor the delivery process by framing challenges, validating hypotheses, and quantifying trade-offs to produce deliverables that are truly decision-ready for the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By blending top-tier consulting rigor with an AI-native workflow, you enable senior teams to perform with unprecedented speed and depth, ensuring every strategic insight is backed by robust evidence and structural accuracy. This role transcends traditional requirements documentation; you are the engine of execution that translates high-level strategic intent into measurable, high-impact business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Due to the nature of the projects and specific client security clearance, this role requires the successful candidate to be a Singapore Citizen or PR of Singapore.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You drive research and analysis by performing core advisory and consulting activities including: Industry and market research, Technology landscape assessments, Business process analysis, Data analysis and interpretation, Competitive benchmarking, Opportunity identification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You leverage AI-enabled tools to accelerate research and analysis while maintaining high standards of quality and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You translate Business Problems into Actionable Insights. You work with clients and engagement teams to understand business objectives and challenges, gather and synthesize qualitative and quantitative information, structure complex problems into manageable workstreams. You identify patterns, risks, opportunities, and trade-offs and develop evidence-based recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You support client engagements by contributing to client-facing advisory work by preparing executive-ready presentations and deliverables &amp;amp; facilitating workshops and discovery sessions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You document business and technology requirements, support strategic assessments and roadmap development and help clients evaluate technology options and transformation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You apply AI to enhance delivery by using AI responsibly to improve the speed and quality of advisory work by accelerating research and information synthesis and supporting analysis and content development. You develop repeatable prompts and workflows, validate AI-generated outputs for accuracy and relevance and continuously improve how advisory work is delivered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You ensure quality and delivery excellence by reviewing work products to ensure they are accurate, well-structured, insightful, client-ready and supported by evidence. You identify gaps, inconsistencies, and risks before deliverables are shared with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You contribute to continuous improvement by helping to strengthen the Technology Advisory practice by capturing reusable frameworks, templates, and methodologies and sharing lessons learned across engagements. You improve research approaches and analytical methods and contribute to internal knowledge assets and AI-enabled delivery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience in one or more of the following: Management or technology consulting, Business analysis, Technology strategy, Product or digital transformation or Data, research, or analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your experience working on technology-enabled business initiatives is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in Business &amp;amp; Technology Analysis and have strong analytical and critical thinking skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to connect business needs with technology solutions and you are comfortable working with ambiguity and complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a structured problem solver, breaking down complex challenges into logical components, synthesizing information into clear recommendations and thinking strategically while remaining detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator written and verbal, you create executive-ready presentations and documentation, and you are able to explain technical concepts to business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are AI-enabled and comfortable using AI tools to enhance research, analysis, and content creation. You understand how to validate AI-generated outputs and continuously explore new ways to improve productivity through AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work collaboratively and effectively across multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You partner closely with Technology Advisors, architects, designers, engineers, and client stakeholders and Builds trusted relationships with clients and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
